| Hunt 2: T1136.001 - Create Local Account
| Author: Wamba José
| Logic: any new local account (Windows Security 4720)

index=endpoint source="*Security*" EventCode=4720
| table _time host user src_user
| rename user as "New Account", src_user as "Created By"

| Hunt query (Sysmon process creation):
| index=endpoint source="XmlWinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational" EventCode=1
| (Image="*\\net.exe" OR Image="*\\net1.exe") CommandLine="*/add*"
| | table _time User ParentImage Image CommandLine
